OL,3,AChina resumes rescue efforts at
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border after fears of
OL,5,Asecond flood halted operations
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Tibet, three people have died and
OL,8,Fmore than 550 are missing. It is not
OL,9,Fclear if the latest figures overlap
OL,11,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,12,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,13,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,14,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,15,Fborder crossing
OL,17,FTens of thousands of tourists visit the
OL,18,Farea every year - the BBC has been
OL,19,Fspeaking to relatives of the missing.
OL,20,FTwo sisters whose parents are missing
OL,21,Fsay "we just love them a lot and want
OL,22,Fthem to come home"
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
